`render.yaml` defines `nq-api` (Python 3.12, plan `pro`, `RENDER=true`, health `/health`, auto-deploy) and `nq-openbb` (Docker, plan `standard`). Comments say `quantastra-agent` and `nq-trader` are extra Render workers **not** in the blueprint, and Hermes is on GCP.

