### 3.2 End-to-end data flow

1. **Universe.** Static lists `data/universe/us_sp500.json` (**503** names) and `data/universe/in_nifty200.json` (**200** names). A later path treats the India universe as the QuantFactor sheet (~498–502 names) rather than the static 200. `universe.py`’s own docstring still says 500 US + 200 IN.
