**Why the scores land where they do**
- **A** is the only direction where all of these hold together:
  - it uses the patent's actual lead claim [EXT §2]
  - it is backed by regulation in all three countries [EXT §5.2]
  - it keeps you out of the licence trap, because the customer is the licensed party [EXT §5.3]
